Introduction "A beginner-friendly greedy branch for continuous knapsack:
first learn how proof-carrying certificates expose bundled facts, then use
those certificates to make the greedy choice's safety and feasibility easy.
After that, establish the density bounds behind the exchange argument and
assemble the witness, upper bound, optimality theorem, and certified
implementation."
